# Large baseline artifacts (eval videos, logs) are not tracked in git; only the
# default-run policies (baselines/checkpoints/) and eval videos (baselines/evals/*.mp4).
baselines/*
!baselines/checkpoints/
!baselines/evals/
baselines/evals/*
!baselines/evals/*.mp4

# Checkpoints/eval videos of policies with >=25% deterministic success are hosted on Hugging
# Face (myohub/myosuite-3-baselines) instead, and downloaded on demand -- see
# baselines/checkpoints/README.md. Keep the local copies (present after a local training run,
# or after that download) out of git so they don't get re-added by accident.
baselines/checkpoints/myoArmReachFixed-v0/
baselines/checkpoints/myoArmReachRandom-v0/
